<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Oct trade data due for release from Thurs.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Oct trade data due for release from Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African October trade figures will not be released before Thursday, a Customs and Excise official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Officials had said last week the data might be available from Tuesday. The department said it could not yet give an exact date for the data.</p>
<p>South African October consumer inflation figures are due at 0900 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
